                            "To render silken or silklike."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "700eb723-2026-4bb5-b79e-c108cf10e10b",
                                "sense_id": "df153888-51ff-337f-9482-443104c19493",
                                "text": "silkening body lotion"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36df4f87-9799-42a8-ad2d-b0c81d87d94b",
                                "sense_id": "df153888-51ff-337f-9482-443104c19493",
                                "text": "Or, if your sheep are of Silurian breed,\nNightly to house them dry on fern or straw,\nSilk’ning their fleeces."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f54af02-1813-4d7d-858b-2619520430a7",
                                "sense_id": "df153888-51ff-337f-9482-443104c19493",
                                "text": "[…] these lights silkened her black skin:"
